   "localizations": {
    "es": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "Beta · βᵢ"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "Regression of monthly returns vs %@": {
   "localizations": {
    "es": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "Regresión de retornos mensuales vs %@"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "· %lld months · R² = %@": {
   "localizations": {
    "es": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "· %lld meses · R² = %@"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "Each dot is one month: how the market moved (across) and how %@ moved (up). The slope of the gold line is β.": {
   "localizations": {
    "es": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "Cada punto es un mes: cuánto se movió el mercado (horizontal) y cuánto se movió %@ (vertical). La pendiente de la recta dorada es β."
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "**E[Rₘ]** is not a direct input: it needs its own formula. We chain into the Gordon model…": {
   "localizations": {
    "es": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "**E[Rₘ]** no es un dato directo: necesita su propia fórmula. Encadenamos al modelo de Gordon…"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "Expected market return · the Gordon model": {
   "localizations": {
    "es": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "Retorno esperado del mercado · modelo de Gordon"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "Market dividend yield": {
   "localizations": {
    "es": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "Dividend yield del mercado"
