   "localizations": {
    "es": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "(ajustable)"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "We carry **E[Rₘ] = %@** back into the main formula.": {
   "localizations": {
    "es": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "Llevamos **E[Rₘ] = %@** de vuelta a la fórmula principal."
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "We plug each value into the formula": {
   "localizations": {
    "es": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "Metemos cada valor en la fórmula"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "Expected return (CAPM) · %@": {
   "localizations": {
    "es": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "Retorno esperado (CAPM) · %@"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "Note: it comes out below the risk-free asset: very low beta and a tight market premium.": {
   "localizations": {
    "es": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "Ojo: sale por debajo del activo sin riesgo: beta muy baja y prima de mercado ajustada."
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "Could not calculate **%@**: %@": {
   "localizations": {
    "es": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "No se pudo calcular **%@**: %@"
