  "According to CAPM, an investor should demand around **%@** a year for holding %@, given its risk (β=%@) against the market.": {
   "localizations": {
    "es": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "Según CAPM, un inversor debería exigir en torno a **%@** anual por tener %@, dado su riesgo (β=%@) frente al mercado."
     }
    }
